C03: the reviewed conductor proposes the privacy-sensitive page read to the root reviewer (WEB1541)

WEB1539 measured that the mind decided browser.page.read for «resumime esta página» and the product prepared the operation with a confirmation, but the reviewed conductor admitted only navigation, close, clicks, settings, clipboard and captures and rejected the turn (review_pending_not_supported). The page read, privacy-sensitive like the captures, is now proposed to the root reviewer the same way; nothing else in the reviewable list changes.

